From 75afc26f19d06abd752517a449a46d38c362f5af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:03:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(geometry): preserve faces and edges on touching
 solids

Link contact fragments only when their matching is unique.
Use the same contact rule for slicing, winding and feature edges.
Preserve refusals for malformed models.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2845
